        "Description": "The easiest version that will actually get you the challenge complete. No repeat kill types, no bs. Easiest to start out with the Durian and a pistol in your loadout.\r\rExplosion kill uses propane, fire kill uses oil barrel, fire kill uses oil barrel, electrocution kill uses the puddle and screwdriver.\r\rPropane found by concession stands, screwdriver is to the right of the bazaar entrance",
